title: "GH-806: publish and reuse the eval query-set contract across help, errors, SDK, and machine discovery"
description: "The shipped pm eval gate accepts a curated query-set schema, but normal discovery paths omit the accepted top-level shapes and relevant_ids contract while malformed-content errors discard the existing actionable example."
