acceptance_criteria: The accepted eval query-set shapes and fields are represented by one public SDK contract; pm eval help and explain expose a copy-pasteable valid example within the command output budget; Malformed-content errors reuse the same actionable examples as missing-file errors; pm contracts exposes the query-set input contract without requiring trial-and-error; Focused tests and exact repository coverage remain green
